  <jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:9pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３　配当に関する事項&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(1) 配当金支払額&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;　　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_head6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;padding-left:18pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;text-align:justify;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(2) 基準日が当事業年度に属する配当のうち、配当の効力発生日が翌事業年度となるもの&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;　　該当事項はありません。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:27pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:12pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:NotesRegardingDividendTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:ReconciliationOfEndingBalanceOfCashAndCashEquivalentsWithAccountBalancesPerBalanceSheetTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearDuration_NonConsolidatedMember">&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;※１　現金及び現金同等物の期末残高と貸借対照表に掲記されている科目の金額との関係&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:right;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:5pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;（単位：千円）&lt;/p&gt;
